    <title>04.从我的虚无主义到《我的阿勒泰》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664f00a54efbc0c3dc89e3cd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664f00a54efbc0c3dc89e3cd</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 May 2024 08:39:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> 为什么我们特想聊聊虚无主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 我俩怎么发现虚无主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">06:57</a>中医里面讲究阴阳平衡提供了解答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a>:聊聊虚无祖师爷——尼采</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a> 生活中感受到手机加快了虚无主义的到来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">18:17</a>VC和七仔分别体验到的最活在当下的moment</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 我俩如何在平常生活中从虚无回到当下的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">32:02</a>读了《我的阿勒泰》给VC的感受</span></p>]]></description>
