  <item>
    <title>01.生而为女，&quot;小胡子&quot;扎到你,我不抱歉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66210e6e48c40e2fb02e010f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66210e6e48c40e2fb02e010f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Apr 2024 12:13:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:00:27</a>女生”禁忌“话题大揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:00:58</a>VC：我是一个长着小胡子的美女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">00:04:47</a>高中时有男生对我说”我们集资送剃须刀作为你的生日礼物“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">00:05:50</a>VC”怎么我的小胡子扎到你了？“与小胡子的和解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">00:07:25</a>困住七仔的“喉结”问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">00:11:05</a>医生说正常以后七仔和“喉结”和解了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">00:14:46</a>慢慢发现现在大家的审美拓宽了，也多元化了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">00:23:18</a>啥?出拯救婚姻内衣了?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1628">00:27:08</a>有小胡子的女生，喜欢粉色唇膏的男生</span></p>]]></description>
