  <item>
    <title>intro：两个不新鲜的00后样本|出逃互联网5年，归来仍是野人，向你发出好友邀请</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6615515148c40e2fb04373fd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6615515148c40e2fb04373fd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Apr 2024 14:31:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024年的第100天，微醺的话唠维C🍷和内向社恐的七仔👽的播客首秀</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们没疯，这只不过是一位看似高冷美女实则话唠&amp;另一位外表内向好学生内在颠婆的双面人生自述</span></p><span></span><p><span>干杯🍻！Cheers🥂！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:00:10</a> 一首libertango 让我们舞起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">00:01:09</a>维C和七仔没有任何水花的博主时光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">00:02:05</a>我们是逃离互联网5年的野人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">00:11:45</a>维C和七仔互相揭秘被撕裂的初印象，七仔曾说VC是小汤唯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a>维C读研感孤独，过上了vlog中的生活却，身在福中不知福的“彼岸不是用来到达”的二三感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a>七仔首次“怒撕”老好人标签，再也不想当朋友圈里的“讨好型透明人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">00:25:10</a>“孤独是我自的选择”老友记瑞秋成长和维C的相似人生，叛逆的甜心，在冒险刺激以及孤独中得到慰藉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1639">00:27:19</a>瑞秋叛逆离婚的妈妈的经典台词“you didn't marry your Barry，but I married mine”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a>什么维C竟然是一个i人？！维C一个常常主持大型校园活动且爱presentation的非典型i人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a>七仔一个典型i人，但，在看热闹时外向的可怕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a>那就让我们与孤独和解，与之共舞。（接着奏乐，接着舞💃🏻）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmrZBSPRKU3okPwCV82HLmnec20j.m4a" length="35488455" type="audio/mp4"/>
